cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it with the metadata below (and the paper it supports, once published)."
type: software
title: "SOTHE-P2-RAD: steady Cherenkov emission and recoil dynamics of solitons with third-order dispersion"
abstract: >-
  Python (NumPy, SciPy, Matplotlib) package for the emission computations of the second SOTHE paper: split-step
  integration of the generalized nonlinear Schroedinger equation with third-order dispersion for adiabatically prepared
  and for launched solitons, the steady Cherenkov emission rate measured from the radiation behind the soliton, the
  scaled rate function of the local soliton, and a norm- and momentum-balance model of the recoil of a resonantly
  radiating soliton, with the article figure and tables. Runs on a laptop or on a SLURM cluster.
